{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"All the rooms in Berlin, Potsdam, and Sanssouci, where I wanted to see something, cost one ducat — or should cost! I will advise my acquaintances who might like to see works of art to take the ducats and thalers that are required for everything and anything — even the grave not only of Frederick the Great but also of his dogs in Sanssouci — and use them to cover the travel expenses to Vienna, and then see here the most magnificent treasures, more in reality than they can currently see in Berlin. — Read some of this to my so dear and worthy friend, Privy Councillor Schulze, — precisely so that he may rightly perceive my gratitude from it for all the love and goodness that has come to me through his benevolent, heartfelt interest, and assure him that, despite all the above, I have given the professors here the opportunity to see that we have no one to envy — on the contrary! — But in order to forcibly return to my report, I briefly report that this afternoon I visited the beautiful Schönbrunn with its views once more, also the menagerie, though only the layout and of the beast population only the royal ones, the elephant and the ostrich, — the rest of the rabble had already gone to sleep. Likewise the plants, and since the flowers do not show themselves with a lantern, I have also spared this for another time — finally — today no Fodor, no Dardanelli, no Lablache, no etc.! The end is bad — everything is bad, namely still a piece of a Leopoldstheater piece, of which I bring the slip. — Tomorrow at the crack of dawn onto the galloping carriage — God guide the driver! This is all that the wishes of my breast are limited to for the time being"}}],"created":1795220681,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":373,"prompt_tokens":487,"total_tokens":860,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-JVagOgCF9iOP37no5IqhPY6wJ9BzpBrm","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":487,"prompt_ms":645.642,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.3257535934291582,"prompt_per_second":754.2879800260824,"predicted_n":373,"predicted_ms":8895.51,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.912661290322582,"predicted_per_second":41.81885018396922}}